### Phase 2 — Frontend Logic

After I approve Phase 1, implement the frontend application logic while keeping the existing UI intact.

Implement:

* Client-side state management
* Form handling
* Validation
* Upload state management
* Document state management
* Conversation state
* Chat state
* Loading/error/success states
