Do NOT implement the actual backend, database, RAG pipeline, Pinecone integration, Gemini integration, or document-processing infrastructure yet.

Keep frontend logic modular and easy to connect to the backend in Phase 3.

**Stop after Phase 2 and ask for my approval before continuing.**

