Implement the Upstash Workflow/QStash pipeline:

```text
PDF
 ↓
Extract text
 ↓
Preserve pages
 ↓
Chunk
 ↓
Generate embeddings
 ↓
Upsert Pinecone
 ↓
Update PostgreSQL
 ↓
READY
```

Make processing:

* Retryable
* Idempotent
* Secure
* Observable

